{title: Holy, holy, holy}
{x_theme: praise, worship}
{x_source: docx:1. Incomplete/Holy, holy, holy(1).docx}

{comment: Chorus}
Holy, holy, holy - holy, holy, holy
Holy is the Lord God almighty
He is worthy to receive glory, worthy to receive honor
Worthy to receive all my praise today

{comment: Bridge}
Praise Him, praise Him and lift Him up
Praise Him, exalt His name forever
